{"reviews":[{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-0","r":1.0,"t":"Not the same","x":"Works as a lotion but if you want the scent this is not the same as from the store.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-1","r":4.0,"t":"Rlly soothing scent PERFECT for the winter","x":"Rlly soothing scent PERFECT for the winter. It smells like a sweet vanilla and marshmallow smell. The reason I only gave it four stars, though is because it's just a little too sweet and it's very strong but if you like sweet strong scents then you'll love it.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2015"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-2","r":4.0,"t":"Very pure vanilla fragrance","x":"I agree with other reviewers that this has a much more true vanilla scent than Warm Vanilla Sugar, particularly since they revised the formula of that one and it no longer smells as good as it used to (more of a chemical overtone).  My daughter and I both eagerly tried this one and like it for the purer vanilla scent.  However, we have decided that we prefer the other product for the other more complex tones - sandalwood and coconut.  We will enjoy using both, but neither of us is inclined to th","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"love","x":"MY FAVORITE scent. it\u2019s like a cookie. a lot of vanilla smells to me kinda smell like burnt skin... if you tan you\u2019ll know what i\u2019m talking about ...  but not this. it\u2019s perfect. it\u2019s may of 2020 and the smell still sells fresh as if i bought it during christmas at bath and body works. (sometimes lotions get old and have that \u201cold\u201d smell to it ) not this .... it\u2019s fresh and perfect","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Madagascar on my skin!","x":"It\u2019s delicious. Smells like it\u2019s edible and feels thick but not oily. Love in a vanilla bean bottle right here.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"the best scent ever.","x":"i've been wearing this lotion since i was 13 and my mom gave me a bottle for christmas. it has been my all time favorite scent ever since and i'm always gutted when i run out before the holidays so i cant buy another bottle in store.  i didnt really know what to expect ordering it here but they sent the newer 2021 edition instead of the 2020 like the picture, which was cool. it was sealed and in perfect condition and it still smells very strong and the same pure sweet vanilla scent like the stuf","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Like a combination of Vanilla Bean and Brown Sugar","x":"I've been using Laura Mercier's Ambre Vanille which is much more expensive and honestly, I like the scent of Vanilla Bean Noel better.  It also makes my skin silky soft and velvety smooth.  A great find.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product","x":"To bad it only comes out once a year. Sure smells good \ud83d\udc4d","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"It\u2019s good lotion","x":"It\u2019s good lotion.  Smells like vanilla frosting.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"One of my faves","x":"This is probably my favorite lotion from bath and body. A lot of vanilla lotions are mixed with amber and smell too warm and too alluring to wear at someplace like the workplace, but not this. This is just a wonderful rich vanilla scent that puts me in a good mood!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Smells AMAZING!! And stays with you!!!","x":"I had to get this bottle for my 10 year old granddaughter as she LOVED mine so much I didn\u2019t want her to use all mine up!! Sooo when I found it \u201coff-season\u201d on Amazon I had to get it for her!! She thinks she is all that now and it\u2019s so frickin funny \ud83d\ude06","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-11","r":2.0,"t":"I was disappointed in the scent of the lotion","x":"I was disappointed in the scent of the lotion; not like the foaming hand soap which I love. No fault of amazon but maybe should be noted.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Vanilla bean Noel hand lotion","x":"I love love this hand lotion. Not greasy, soft smooth feel and the fragrance is the best! Smells romantic \ud83e\udd70","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-13","r":1.0,"t":"I have a friend who collects bear stuff and so this was perfect for her","x":"I was expecting to get the lotion that is in the picture with the bear on it with the green lid and I ended up getting one with a deer on it with a gold lid. I have a friend who collects bear stuff and so this was perfect for her, Now I have to just give her the deer one.  Thanks for nothing. If there wasn't anymore with bears on it than maybe take the picture down, it was very misleading!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-14","r":4.0,"t":"Good Quality Lotion","x":"Even though I received the 2019 version of the product, it held up just as well as the lotion for 2020. The scent is just as strong, the consistency held up, and it softens skin just great. Overall I'm surprisingly pleased with this purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-15","r":4.0,"t":"A great smelling lotion","x":"This lotion sent is very delightful. This lotion is great for just hopping out of the shower it leaves your skin feeling soft and nourished  I wish it was a little bit thicker but I would definitely buy this product again!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-16","r":1.0,"t":"Scent Not What Expected","x":"The scent is nothing like what I have bought directly from Bath and Body Works.  My five-year-old noticed a difference and we both agreed it smelled bad.  Very disappointing.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Gifting for teens","x":"I bought this for my daughter, this his her favorite scent! I can only find this scent around the holiday season. Her birthday is in July. She is very pleased!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-18","r":1.0,"t":"Not the real bath and body works noel","x":"I was very disappointed I love bath and body works vanilla bean Noel this is not it I don\u2019t no what this is it has really no smell a waste of monies","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Smells GREAT!  Like a cookie!","x":"Scent longevity could be better.  The scent usually only lasts a few hours.  I like the cookie scent because, who doesn't like cookies!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-20","r":5.0,"t":"This my favorite of all the winter scents","x":"This my favorite of all the winter scents! They're all very lovely but Vanilla Bean Noel's the best! It's sweet but not strong.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Best vanilla scented lotion ever!","x":"This is the best vanilla lotion on the market. The scent really lasts and I get compliments regularly re: how good it smells.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-22","r":5.0,"t":"love this body lotion","x":"love this body lotion, it is so delisious smelling like vanilla ice creme. going to by more of theier wonderful scents","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-23","r":2.0,"t":"Two Stars","x":"It does not have the same scent. It smells as if it was diluted and smells faintly of plastic.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B00OM8KWDQ-24","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite lotion","x":"This is my favorite lotion of all time.  It arrive on time and in perfect condition.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers love the scent, describing it as a sweet, true vanilla that smells like cookies, frosting, or marshmallow.","cites":[2,3,4,5,7,9,10,11,13]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the lotion's texture, saying it leaves skin soft and smooth without being greasy or oily.","cites":[5,7,13,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers were disappointed that the scent or packaging differed from what they expected or from the store version.","cites":[1,12,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the scent is very strong and a bit too sweet.","cites":[2]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention the scent lasts a long time and stays fresh.","cites":[4,11,15]}]},"qa":[]}